words:—Lord Mayor, lady help, Lady Superior, deputy Speaker, soldier statesman, mastiff puppy.
===
words:—*Lord Mayor, lady help, Lady Superior, deputy Speaker, soldier statesman, mastiff puppy*.
>>>

<<<
following list except fellowship &
===
following list except *fellowship* &
>>>

<<<
+ f.-feeling as two separate words;

& no-one need shrink from writing

so any of those in which a hyphen is

not here inserted or any still less
===
+ *f.-feeling* as two separate words; & no-one need shrink from writing so any of those in which a hyphen is not here inserted or any still less
>>>

<<<
any still less

familiar combination;
