it is usual:— f. author, f. Christian, f.-citizen, f.commoner, f.-countryman, f. craftsman, f.-creature, f. executor, f.-feeling or fellowfeeling, f. heir, f. lodger, f-man, f. passenger,
===
it is usual:— *f. author, f. Christian, f.-citizen, f.-commoner, f.-countryman, f. craftsman, f.-creature, f. executor, f.-feeling or fellowfeeling, f. heir, f. lodger, f.-man, f. passenger,*
>>>

